        <ezobject:attribute xmlns:ezremote="http://ez.no/ezobject" ezremote:id="1663" ezremote:identifier="description" name="Description" type="ezxmltext">
          <section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/">
            <paragraph>At Home Lower Body Workout WITHOUT Equipment.</paragraph>
            <paragraph>HIIT routines are a great way to increase your heart health, build endurance, and burn fat quickly due to the minimal rest that you get between exercises. If you’re looking for an at home workout, an exercise routine you can do quickly, and a workout that requires zero equipment, this tabata-style HIIT routine is just for you! Enjoy!</paragraph>
          </section>
